sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant L as Load balancer
    participant S as App server
    participant B as S3
    participant P as Postgres primary

    U->>L: POST /pastes {text, type, language, expiresIn}
    L->>S: forward request
    S->>S: check 10,000 character limit
    S->>S: generate random 7-character code
    opt text over 10 KB
        S->>B: upload text
    end
    loop until the insert succeeds
        S->>P: INSERT row (code is the primary key)
        alt code already taken
            P-->>S: duplicate key error
            S->>S: generate a new code
        else saved
            P-->>S: OK
        end
    end
    S-->>U: short link + expiresAt
